### Parser body (product host source)

File: `/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/ooda/oodac/c_emit_secret.oo`

- L7–82: `pub fn c_parse_secret_env(src: String) -> String`
- L8: needle is `"// " + "SECRET:"` (same split; match unchanged)
- L13–21: line-start only (`i==0` or prev char `\n`)
- L23–32: exact needle walk
- L34–42: skip spaces/tabs after `// SECRET:`
- L43: `let start = k;` — ident start index
- L44–64: advance `k` while alnum/`_` (same `is_al` class as before,
  including leading digits — **not** 7.1 start-vs-cont)
- **L65:** `let name = str_slice(src, start, k);`  ← one slice
- L66–69: empty name → `ERR\tsecret\tinvalid name …` + `process_exit(1)`
- L70: `c_env_put(env, "__sec__" + name, "1")`
- L72: `c_env_put(env, "__secref__" + name, "1")` (sticky-clear root)

Pre-fix L60 was `name = name + c` inside the ident loop (O(token²)
OoStr concat). That line is **gone**.

Static grep of this file for `name = name +`, `name + c`: **no hits**.
`str_slice` hits: L65 (this close) and L254 (`__sec_sink__` prefix, unrelated).

### Semantics kept (do not change)

| Rule | Still |
|------|--------|
| Line-start `// SECRET:` only | yes |
| Spaces/tabs after `:` skipped | yes |
| Ident class `_` / A–Z / a–z / 0–9 from first char | yes (not 7.1 is_start) |
| Empty ident fail-closed | yes |
| `__sec__` + `__secref__` both put | yes |
| Mid-line `// SECRET:` ignored | yes (T2 midline rail) |

### Stack / buffer honesty

| Layer | What happens | Class |
|-------|----------------|-------|
| Ident accumulate | `str_slice` once per directive name | **path-A** — no O(token²) concat |
| Runtime `oo_str_slice` | one alloc + memcpy of the span | O(\|ident\|) heap, honest |
| Walk `char_at` | runtime 1-char `OoStr` per visit | O(\|src\|) 1-byte temps — **language floor**, not 7.10 leak |
| C stack `char buf[N]` | not expressible in `.oo` | not required for alpha close |
| `__sec__` + name | one prefix concat per directive | O(1) per hit, not per-char |

Complexity: time O(|src|) char visits; aux = O(1) scalars + one name
slice per `// SECRET:` hit. No growing concat buffer on the ident.

